                "message": "refactor: Migrate to the Cython 3.1+ enum API.\n\nCython 3.1 dropped module-level cpdef-enum members, so use the\n`EnumClass.MEMBER` form, regenerate the .pyi stubs, and drop the\ntemporary `cython==3.0.11` pins.",
